sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser UI
    participant AppJS as app.js
    participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware
    participant Attr as RequireRoleAttribute
    participant Ctrl as ApprovalsController
    participant Base as ApiControllerBase
    participant Service as ApprovalService
    participant Repo as InMemoryInvoiceRepository

    Note over Browser,AppJS: Click Approve on pending invoice<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js:72
    Browser->>AppJS: click approve button
    AppJS->>AppJS: decide('/approvals/{id}/approve', {})<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js:82-90
    AppJS->>AppJS: api('/approvals/{id}/approve', { method: 'POST' })<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js:16-24
    AppJS->>MW: HTTP POST /api/approvals/{id}/approve
    Note right of MW: Authorization check in SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:14-35

    alt Missing/invalid bearer token or no session
        MW-->>AppJS: 401 Unauthorized
        Note right of MW: SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:18-28
        AppJS-->>Browser: show error
    else Valid session present
        MW->>MW: context.Items["session"] = session
        MW->>Attr: continue action pipeline
        Note right of Attr: RequireRoleAttribute.cs:9-25

        alt User has no Approver/Admin role
            Attr-->>AppJS: 403 Forbidden
            Note right of Attr: RequireRoleAttribute.cs:15-23
            AppJS-->>Browser: show error
        else Authorized role
            Attr->>Ctrl: Approve(invoiceId)
            Note right of Ctrl: ApprovalsController.cs:8-28
            Ctrl->>Base: Handle(() => _approvals.Approve(invoiceId, HttpContext.GetSession().Username))
            Note right of Base: ApiControllerBase.cs:6-23

            Base->>Service: _approvals.Approve(invoiceId, approver)
            Note right of Service: ApprovalService.Approve is backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs:31-41, and Submit is 21-29

            Service->>Repo: GetById(invoiceId)<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs:25-28
            Repo-->>Service: invoice or null
            Note over Service,Repo: GetById returns the live shared object in the in-memory list, and the status check in EnsurePending plus the later Update() are not atomic

            alt Invoice not found
                Service-->>Base: throw KeyNotFoundException
                Base-->>Ctrl: NotFound(new { error = ex.Message })
                Ctrl-->>AppJS: 404 Not Found
                AppJS-->>Browser: show error
            else Invoice exists but not PendingApproval
                Service->>Service: EnsurePending(invoice)
                Service-->>Base: throw InvalidOperationException
                Base-->>Ctrl: Conflict(new { error = ex.Message })
                Ctrl-->>AppJS: 409 Conflict
                AppJS-->>Browser: show error
            else Invoice can be approved
                Service->>Service: invoice.Status = Approved
                Service->>Service: invoice.DecidedBy = approver
                Service->>Service: invoice.DecidedAt = DateTime.UtcNow
                Service->>Repo: Update(invoice)<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs:50-57
                Note right of Repo: Update returns void and replaces the matching invoice instance in the shared in-memory list
                Repo-->>Service: void
                Service-->>Base: Invoice
                Base-->>Ctrl: Ok(invoice)
                Ctrl-->>AppJS: 200 OK with updated invoice
                AppJS->>AppJS: refresh()
                AppJS-->>Browser: UI refreshes pending list
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Browser,AppJS: Sources
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Browser UI click: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js:60-68, 76-82, 83-103
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Middleware auth: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Auth/SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:14-35
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Role gate: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Auth/RequireRoleAttribute.cs:9-25
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Controller: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Controllers/ApprovalsController.cs:8-27
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Handle mapping: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Controllers/ApiControllerBase.cs:6-23
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Domain logic: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs:21-34, 47-55
    Note over Browser,AppJS: Repository: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs:20-25, 41-48
